sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ARCtrl as AgentRuntime Controller
    participant Webhook as AuthBridge Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Keycloak as Keycloak (RHBK)<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant AgentPod as Agent Pod
    participant AuthBridge as AuthBridge Sidecar<br/>3128/TCP fwd, 8080/TCP rev
    participant TokenBroker as Token Broker<br/>8190/TCP HTTP
    participant OAuthProvider as OAuth Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant AgentB as Agent B (AuthBridge)<br/>8080/TCP mTLS
    participant ACCtrl as AgentCard Controller
    participant SPIRE as SPIRE Agent<br/>Unix Socket mTLS
    participant BundleSvc as Bundle Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Note over User,BundleSvc: Flow 1: Agent Enrollment via AgentRuntime

    User->>K8sAPI: POST AgentRuntime CR<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
    K8sAPI->>ARCtrl: Watch event (TLS 1.2+, SA token)
    ARCtrl->>K8sAPI: Mutate target Deployment labels<br/>SA token
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Pod CREATE admission<br/>9443/TCP, TLS 1.2+, API server mTLS
    Webhook->>AgentPod: Inject AuthBridge sidecar<br/>+ proxy-init (iptables)
    ARCtrl->>Keycloak: Register OAuth client<br/>8080/TCP, admin creds / JWT-SVID
    Keycloak-->>ARCtrl: Client credentials
    ARCtrl->>AgentPod: Fetch A2A agent card<br/>8000/TCP, mTLS (optional)
    ARCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create AgentCard CR<br/>SA token

    Note over User,BundleSvc: Flow 2: Agent-to-Agent Communication (mTLS)

    AgentPod->>AuthBridge: Outbound request via HTTP_PROXY<br/>3128/TCP, localhost
    AuthBridge->>TokenBroker: POST /sessions/token<br/>8190/TCP, Bearer JWT
    TokenBroker->>OAuthProvider: PKCE code exchange<br/>443/TCP, TLS 1.2+, client_secret
    OAuthProvider-->>TokenBroker: Access token
    TokenBroker-->>AuthBridge: Bearer token
    AuthBridge->>AgentB: mTLS request<br/>8080/TCP, X.509-SVID
    AgentB->>AgentB: Validate JWT + IBAC (OPA)
    AgentB-->>AuthBridge: Response
    AuthBridge-->>AgentPod: Proxied response

    Note over User,BundleSvc: Flow 3: Agent Card Discovery & Verification

    ACCtrl->>AgentPod: Fetch /.well-known/agent.json<br/>8000/TCP, mTLS (SPIFFE)
    ACCtrl->>SPIRE: Get trust bundle<br/>Unix socket, mTLS
    SPIRE-->>ACCtrl: X.509 trust bundle
    ACCtrl->>ACCtrl: Verify JWS signature<br/>+ SPIFFE identity binding
    ACCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update AgentCard status<br/>verificationStatus: verified
    ACCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/update NetworkPolicy<br/>(permissive for verified, restrictive for unverified)

    Note over AuthBridge,BundleSvc: Runtime: IBAC Policy Loading

    AuthBridge->>BundleSvc: GET /bundles/{spiffeid}<br/>8080/TCP
    BundleSvc-->>AuthBridge: OPA policy bundle
